<h1>Power BI vs Tableau for Small Business: Which Should You Choose in 2026?</h1>
<p class="meta">By Tycoon Clap · Published October 18, 2026 · 10 min read</p>

<div class="summary">
<strong>Quick answer:</strong> For most small businesses in the US and Canada, Power BI is the better starting point. It costs less per user, fits naturally with Excel and Microsoft 365, and is quicker to roll out. Choose Tableau if your team works on Macs, if visual exploration of data matters more than cost, or if you already run your business on Salesforce. Prices below are US dollar list prices as of October 2026.
</div>

